CORE
prefix.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ prefix increment of prefix increment: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ assignment to assignment: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ through a pointer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
See test.desc.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only
its WRONG assertion.
